{"id":"truppa","lemma":"truppa","pos":"noun","rank":2166,"glosses":["troop (of soldiers)","troops (usually in the plural)","group, band (of people)"],"ipa":"/ˈtrup.pa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"truppe"},"examples":[{"text":"Porta a casa tutte le truppe.","en":"Bring home all the troops.","words":[{"g":"gate"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"everything, all","l":"tutto"},{"g":"the / to her"},null]},{"text":"Il generale ha controllato le truppe.","en":"The general inspected the troops.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"general"},{"g":"has","l":"avere"},{"g":"controlled"},{"g":"the / to her"},null]},{"text":"Il capitano guida bene le sue truppe.","en":"That captain handles his troops well.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"captain"},{"g":"guide"},{"g":"well"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"his"]]},{"text":"Le truppe erano piene di armi.","en":"The troops had plenty of arms.","words":[{"g":"the / to her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"full","l":"pieno"},{"g":"of"},{"g":"weapon, arms","l":"arma"}]},{"text":"Le truppe avanzarono di venti miglia.","en":"The troops advanced twenty miles.","words":[{"g":"the / to her"},null,null,{"g":"of"},{"g":"twenty"},{"g":"the Italian mile","l":"miglio"}]}]}